al [76dda5c6c], v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sequoia (15.7.3) - Godot Engine v4.6.beta3.official\n\n### Issue description\n\nA `GraphFrame` with an overridden `titlebar` stylebox does not display correctly until the node is selected in `GraphEdit`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWith `GraphEdit` as the root node in a scene, add a `GraphFrame` node as its child then override all of its styleboxes with the same `StyleBoxFlat` (i.e. without changing the defaults). Launch the project and notice `GraphFrame`'s titlebar does not size correctly until selection:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7112b5b9-e65a-49dc-8e96-8bd2819cd2ac\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[graphframe-titlebar-incorrect-size.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24517207/graphframe-titlebar-incorrect-size.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"htt